    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, just looking over the Q3 projections and the new efficiency directive from the board. looks like we're gonna have to cut down on the compute spend for the Iceland plants. the plan is to move away from the active optimization layer and just switch over to those pre-programmed static schedules we used last year to save on the cloud costs. thoughts on the transition?",
