    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "k a plan sounds good. just one thing though—i was looking at the sequestration targets for the next two years, and i'm worried that if we drop the optimization, we're gonna miss the climate benchmarks entirely. is there any way we can keep the optimizer running on just a subset of the plants, or is the switch to static schedules going to tank our numbers?",
