      "content": "That is a critical point, as environmental compliance cannot be sacrificed for cost savings. We could explore a hybrid approach where the active optimization layer remains active on a subset of high-impact plants while others transition to static schedules. This might allow us to meet the most stringent sequestration targets while still achieving some cost reductions. Let's analyze which plants offer the best return on investment for keeping the optimizer running.",
